  "story": {
    "title": "Moutushi's Song",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Little Moutushi is very busy today.",
      "She flies from one branch to another on the big neem tree.",
      "On the big neem tree is a big beehive. Bees buzz around, collecting nectar. “I want nectar too,” Moutushi says to herself.",
      "“Let me look around and see if I can find some nectar,” Moutushi thinks.",
      "It is a cold winter afternoon. In a big house by the neem tree, Didima is enjoying the afternoon sun. Flowers are blooming in the pots on the balcony.",
      "Phat Phat Phat! Moutushi flies down to a pretty red flower. She drinks nectar with her needle-like beak.",
      "“Aah, my tummy is full!” Moutushi is feeling sleepy. “I will rock myself to sleep on the branch of this tree.”",
      "Two mynahs come flying to the balcony. They start fighting with each other.",
      "Oh no, Moutushi’s sleep flies away. She hates fighting. Moutushi decides to fly away as well. Phat Phat Phat!",
      "Before she goes, she sings a little song for Didima. “Didima calls, ‘Where are you?’ I am here. Tui, tui, tuu. Didima says, ‘Are you lost, are you?’ No, I am right here. Tui, tui, tuu. Didima asks, ‘Did you drink the nectar, did you?’ Yes, my tummy is full. Tui, tui, tuu.”"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Little Moutushi is very busy today.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bé Moutushi hôm nay rất bận rộn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She flies from one branch to another on the big neem tree.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé bay từ cành này sang cành khác trên cây sầu đâu to lớn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "On the big neem tree is a big beehive.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trên cây sầu đâu to lớn có một tổ ong rất to."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Bees buzz around, collecting nectar.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những chú ong bay vo ve, hút mật hoa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I want nectar too,” Moutushi says to herself.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Mình cũng muốn mật hoa,” Moutushi tự nhủ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Let me look around and see if I can find some nectar,” Moutushi thinks.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Để mình nhìn xung quanh xem có tìm được mật hoa nào không,” Moutushi nghĩ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It is a cold winter afternoon.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đó là một buổi chiều mùa đông lạnh giá."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In a big house by the neem tree, Didima is enjoying the afternoon sun.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong một ngôi nhà lớn cạnh cây sầu đâu, Didima đang tận hưởng nắng chiều."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Flowers are blooming in the pots on the balcony.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những bông hoa đang nở rộ trong các chậu cây trên ban công."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Phat Phat Phat!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Phành phạch phành phạch phành phạch!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Moutushi flies down to a pretty red flower.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Moutushi bay xuống một bông hoa đỏ xinh xắn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She drinks nectar with her needle-like beak.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé hút mật hoa bằng cái mỏ nhọn như kim của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Aah, my tummy is full!” Moutushi is feeling sleepy.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Aah, bụng mình no căng rồi!” Moutushi cảm thấy buồn ngủ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I will rock myself to sleep on the branch of this tree.”",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Mình sẽ đu đưa trên cành cây này để ngủ.”"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Two mynahs come flying to the balcony.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai con chim sáo bay đến ban công."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They start fighting with each other.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng bắt đầu đánh nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh no, Moutushi’s sleep flies away.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ôi không, giấc ngủ của Moutushi bay biến mất rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She hates fighting.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé ghét đánh nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Moutushi decides to fly away as well.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Moutushi quyết định bay đi chỗ khác luôn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Phat Phat Phat!",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Phành phạch phành phạch phành phạch!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Before she goes, she sings a little song for Didima.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trước khi đi, cô bé hát một bài hát nhỏ cho Didima."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Didima calls, ‘Where are you?’ I am here.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Didima gọi, ‘Con ở đâu?’ Con ở đây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tui, tui, tuu.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tui, tui, tuu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Didima says, ‘Are you lost, are you?’ No, I am right here.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Didima nói, ‘Con lạc rồi phải không?’ Không, con ở ngay đây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tui, tui, tuu.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tui, tui, tuu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Didima asks, ‘Did you drink the nectar, did you?’ Yes, my tummy is full.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Didima hỏi, ‘Con đã uống mật hoa chưa?’ Rồi, bụng con no rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tui, tui, tuu.”",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_102786/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tui, tui, tuu.”"
      }
    ]
  },
